    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are pleased to bring to the market this 2 bedroom apartment, situated in the town centre within short walking distance of all facilities Carlow has to offer. Carlow is a vibrant town with a host of amenities including pubs, shops, restaurants, hotels, schools and all other services one could require for modern living. The accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, kitchen/diner, living room, 2 good sized bedrooms and a main bathroom.Close to the new Barrow boardwalk this reasonably priced property is suitable for investors or owners looking for a small easily maintained space. Viewing highly recommended. Call DNG McCormack Properties to make an appointment 0599133800.Management Company: Maher Property AdvisorsManagement Fees: 2092.08 per annum\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit mydng.ie and register."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 4.97 x 1.18\nTiled flooring\n\nLiving Room - 3.90 x 5.50\nCarpet flooring\n\nKitchen/Diner - 3.61 x 4.76\nTiled flooring, fitted units at eye and floor level\n\nLanding - 2.12 x 3.20\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.60 x 3.27\nCarpet flooring, double room\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.81 x 3.39\nCarpet flooring, double room\n\nBathroom - 2.47 x 2.62\nLinoleum flooring, tiled half wall and splash area, WC, WHB, bath with shower over\n\n"
